<div class="card h-100">
    <div class="card-header fw-semibold">Transactional outbox</div>
    <div class="card-body">
        <div class="d-flex gap-4 mb-2">
            <div><div class="small text-muted">Pending</div><div class="fs-4">@Stats.OutboxPending</div></div>
            <div><div class="small text-muted">Processed</div><div class="fs-4 text-success">@Stats.OutboxProcessed</div></div>
            <div><div class="small text-muted">Failed</div><div class="fs-4 text-danger">@Stats.OutboxFailed</div></div>
        </div>
        <p class="small text-muted mb-0">
            Domain events (such as <code>DemoAlertRaised</code>) are written in the same transaction as the data
            that raised them and handled afterwards, at least once. Failed rows exhausted their retries.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
